{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the ice in this colorful cartoon style hockey game. Choose your class to dominate the rink. Every match is a mix of chaos, skill, and style. Play online with up to 6 players and battle for the puck on a scenic outdoor rink. Steal the puck, dash to break away, and score some goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your look</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change the color of your jersey, helmet, socks, pants, and stick</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your jersey number and nameplate to stand out on the ice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your playstyle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enforcer - Shoot with more power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Speedster - Skate faster than all your rivals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 6 player online lobbies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom goal limit for short or extended matches</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off to start every round</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch out for the goalies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each net is protected by a goalie that slides across the net. The goalies deflect pucks with unpredictable speed and direction. Be careful, they're extra bouncy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Professional Status</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can optionally upgrade to Professional Status to unlock exclusive customization options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign your game winning goal puck to display in your trophy case</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate your goals with unique animations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Professional&quot; nametag</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock hat customization</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skate with style 